    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to inflict pain using your metal appendages when fighting in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> combat against organic enemies.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Martial_Arts_I\" title=\"Martial Arts I\">Martial Arts I</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you successfully damage an enemy with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed Attack\">Unarmed Attack</a>, the enemy takes a -5 penalty to all melee attack rolls and damage rolls until the start of your next turn.</p><p><b>Special:</b> If you strike an organic enemy while using this Feat during an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a>, the penalty lasts until the start of the enemy's next turn.</p>",
